<pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 20:16:36 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div>正常人眼里的爱国。<br/><br/>1，解决就业。<br/>2，增加纳税。<br/>3，提出合理意见和建议，限制权贵对国有资产的侵占。<br/>4，增加科技竞争力。<br/>5，积极消费，促进经济循环。<br/>6，婚育生娃，积极培养下一代。<br/><br/>小粉红眼里的爱国<br/><br/>1，反抗资本家<br/>2，反美<br/>3，反日<br/>4，反印<br/>5，听习大大的<br/><br/>所以，很抱歉，实在做不到啊。</div><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9881.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918D.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A1.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918E.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4AE.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918F.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
